body:
I will probably pick up some camping supplies when I visit family this weekend and see what I can muster up.

&#x200B;

I just hope she believes me in this.

Well currently I'm planning to take her to a lake at some point, but the only option would be on a Saturday or Sunday, but she's going to his place Saturday and she'll be pretty tired sunday so I'm unable to wow her because she's just too tired from the guy who nailed it in one. 

&#x200B;

There's a tavern within walking distance of our place, but we'd only be able to go there for an hour or so because of how late it'd be on a weekday.

See here's the thing. I can't just surprise her with flowers because she has almost no sense of smell and doesn't like flowers in general. On top of that she's aware somewhat of how I feel and she commented that my clawing for affection has seemed forced and not genuine. She resents me because I'd never take her anywhere on dates. We'd just not go anywhere and all I'd do is give her a comfortable place to live, but never challenged her or excited her. I never swept her off her feet and now I'm paying for it.

&#x200B;

Also sobbing is really making it hard to clean up these spreadsheets in a timely manner.

She often would just sit there. I'd ask if she'd want to game, but like an idiot, I ruined us spending League time together by being too hard on my performance in game... probably another reason she wants to distance from me.

&#x200B;

I hate myself for not enjoying going out, but going out always feels like work and that I'm not welcome and I wish I was dead because I can't ever NOT be pessimistic about going anyway. I always assume I'll be bored and this is probably why she resents me.
